      "landsat": "USGS Collection 2 QA_PIXEL carried into Planetary Computer's same-acquisition Landsat Level-2 scene; Level-1 product ID is cross-checked in the USGS STAC catalog. Level-2 optical bands are not equivalent to AquaCorr aquatic Rrs.",
      "sentinel_2": "Sentinel-2 L2A Scene Classification Layer (SCL) sampled at field coordinate and matched to the Level-1C tile/time. SCL is algorithmic evidence, not a manual truth label."
